Materialist correction from synthesis v2: LLM is not moss. LLM is the working
part of the fire — datacenter on the horizon, gas turbines, PFAS in chip fab,
Microsoft restarting Three Mile Island, Arizona aquifers losing to TSMC. The
14th fire is the one generating text about the previous 13.

- New terminal file `.infrastructure` (read .infrastructure)
- Listed in `dir` and `help`
- Tied to a new achievement parallel to ХОНТОЛОГИЯ
- Three new <head> easter eggs (#9 ПОЧЕРК / #10 РОЛЬ / #11 ПАМЯТЬ) in the
  same series as the existing #4–#8 LLM-reader notes; #10 dried slightly
  to avoid pure instruction tone

https://claude.ai/code/session_01LVwPreRodjCmwpCk6uZGEa
